---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import {services} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Landscape & hardscape services" description="Explore landscape design, hardscaping, and outdoor living services in this fictional premium design-build portfolio demo."><section class="page-intro section"><p class="eyebrow">OUR SERVICES · FICTIONAL BUSINESS</p><h1>Every element.<br/><em>One considered landscape.</em></h1><p>From the first sketch to the smallest material detail, discover a connected approach to the outdoors.</p></section>{services.map((s,i)=><section class="service-detail section" id={s.id}><Photo name={s.image} alt={s.alt}/><div><p class="eyebrow">0{i+1} / DESIGN & BUILD CONCEPT</p><h2>{s.title}</h2><p>{s.text}</p><p class="detail-list">{s.detail}</p><a class="under-link" href={`/contact/?service=${s.id}`}>Discuss this type of project ↗</a></div></section>)}<section class="section faq"><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p><h2>Before we <em>begin.</em></h2><details><summary>How is a project estimate developed?</summary><p>For a real business, scope, site conditions, access, materials, and local requirements would inform a written estimate after consultation. This demo does not provide quotes.</p></details><details><summary>Can a project be built in phases?</summary><p>This sample approach allows a master plan to be considered in phases. A real contractor would confirm feasibility, sequencing, and costs for your site.</p></details><details><summary>Where does Alder & Stone work?</summary><p>Alder & Stone is fictional and has no service area. This website demonstrates a premium experience for U.S. landscaping businesses.</p></details></section><CTA title="Let’s give your ideas room to grow."/></Layout>
